title: "DeepSeek Harness — Agent-Body"
abstract: >-
  A plugin platform that behaves like a body: organs with senses and reflexes, a nervous system that
  routes commands, a heartbeat that pumps state to every organ, reflexes that fire without a model call,
  and a self-healing loop that attributes every failure before retrying it.
